  "content": "\n\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h9dmspH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"auto\" />\n\n<!-- Geckolib -->\n<!-- <div>\n    <hr>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/geckolib\">\n            <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HHe76Ki.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"244\" height=\"82\" />\n        </a>\n    </center>\n</div> -->\n\n<!-- Description -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <center>\n        歡迎來到我們「溫馨」的小家！Cozy 是一款旨在為你的《我的世界》增添各式食物、家具與生活機能提升的模組，讓你的遊戲世界更加生動有趣！\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Mod Contents -->\n<!-- <div>\n    <hr>\n    <div>\n        <h4>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;What does this mod add?</h4>\n        <ul>\n            <li>🦆 A white duck and mallard. They spawn in river biomes</li>\n            <li>🐥 Quacklings: A fisherman duck which is tradable! Find these guys wandering around swamps!</li>\n            <li>🍰 Holiday fruit cake, a sweet treat the quacklings LOVE!</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div> -->\n\n\n<!-- Discord -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <center>\n        🛏️&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/YXC6Xh82yT\">加入我們的 Discord！</a>&nbsp;🛏️\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Credits -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <div>\n        <h4>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;製作人員：</h4>\n        <ul>\n            <li>🎨 Frogipher#4778 (美術)</li>\n            <li>💻 ThatGravyBoat#0001 (程式開發)</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Comments -->\n<!-- <div>\n    <hr>\n    <center>\n        The horror aspect of the mod has been removed as of the 1.19 release.\n    </center>\n</div> -->\n\n<!-- Credit: Modpacks, Videos, etc. -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <center>\n        只要註明出處，Cozy 即可用於整合包、YouTube 影片等用途。\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- Bisecthosting -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/gravy\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f2495544-8c9f-4513-a09d-cac8b85db731.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"auto\" />\n    </a>\n</div>",
